  <entry id="tag:github.com,2008:Repository/10270250/eslint-plugin-react-hooks@7.1.1" updated="2026-04-17T20:51:48Z" title="eslint-plugin-react-hooks@7.1.1 (April 17, 2026)">
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/facebook/react/releases/tag/eslint-plugin-react-hooks%407.1.1"></link>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; 7.1.0 accidentally removed the &lt;code&gt;component-hook-factories&lt;/code&gt; rule, causing errors for users who referenced it in their ESLint config. This is now fixed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add deprecated no-op &lt;code&gt;component-hook-factories&lt;/code&gt; rule for backwards compatibility. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mofeiZ&quot;&gt;@mofeiZ&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/facebook/react/pull/36307&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/facebook/react/pull/36307/hovercard&quot;&gt;#36307&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
